IMAGE_GENERATION_AUTHORIZATION = NO
CUSTOM_CODE_AUTHORIZATION = NO
STATE = ROUTE_LOCKED / RUNTIME INVENTORY REQUIRED / NO VISUAL PASS CLAIMED

## WHY THIS TASK EXISTS
Do not build a second drawing engine. Reuse the already proven SALVADOR local ComfyUI reference-edit path and strengthen reference control using mature stock/open components only.

Fresh reusable evidence:
- historical production implementation head: `425ad97c508c4f55f7d7052435a7a2cb4aa3b015`;
- existing backend: `agent-controller/src/zb_local_controller/backends/canon_reference_edit.py`;
- existing workflow: `agent-controller/src/zb_local_controller/workflows/salvador-canon-reference-edit-v1.json`;
- workflow already uses `CheckpointLoaderSimple -> CLIPTextEncode(+/-) -> LoadImage -> VAEEncode -> KSampler -> VAEDecode -> SaveImage`;
- #71 recorded a real local `RESULT_READY` execution (`619cbaba-03f2-43e6-a1df-7c7291f557b4`) with output SHA256 `69f20660a52750eeafbc97877f0c064d008e8e3fa1ed25dcd005924bed5ec6bf`; visual QC was still pending, so this is execution proof, not visual PASS.

## RESULT-FIRST DECISION
Primary route:
`existing CANON_REFERENCE_EDIT img2img`
`+ plain SD1.5 IP-Adapter reference conditioning (NON-FaceID)`
`+ SD1.5 ControlNet structural conditioning when needed (line/edge/pose/depth)`
`-> existing KSampler / VAE / SaveImage`
`-> existing ZORR drawing/texture QC laws (#199/#201/#202)`

No new Python/TypeScript drawing algorithm. The intended change surface is stock ComfyUI workflow/configuration only unless a concrete gap is proven.

## OSS / LICENSE FILTER
Allowed candidate set:
1. existing ComfyUI core/runtime;
2. upstream `tencent-ailab/IP-Adapter` — Apache-2.0; use plain SD1.5 adapter only;
3. `h94/IP-Adapter` plain SD1.5 weights only after exact per-file license/hash verification;
4. ControlNet SD1.5 structural models only after exact model-card license/hash verification;
5. if a ComfyUI IP-Adapter node pack is required, pin exact revision and treat GPL integration as an explicit dependency decision.

Rejected for R01:
- IP-Adapter FaceID / InsightFace production-default path;
- StoryDiffusion / AniDoc as primary runtime on this machine class because their current published inference memory envelope is far above the existing 4 GB target;
- style2paints pretrained binaries because code license and model/binary rights are not cleanly equivalent;
- a new ZORR retargeter, parser, drawing algorithm, or custom conditioning node.

## FIRST PHYSICAL GATE — READ-ONLY RUNTIME INVENTORY
Before changing any workflow, inspect the actual owner-machine ComfyUI runtime and record:
- ComfyUI version/commit;
- `/object_info` presence of current baseline nodes;
- whether `IPAdapterUnifiedLoader` and `IPAdapterAdvanced` already exist;
- installed SD1.5 checkpoint exact filename/hash;
- installed IP-Adapter / CLIP-Vision files, if any, exact filename/hash;
- installed ControlNet models/preprocessors, if any, exact filename/hash;
- available VRAM/memory mode and startup flags.

Do not install anything until this inventory proves the exact missing layer.

## WORKFLOW LADDER
A — BASELINE CONTROL
Existing `salvador-canon-reference-edit-v1`, unchanged. This is the control condition.

B — IDENTITY REFERENCE
Same source/reference and same base checkpoint, adding plain SD1.5 IP-Adapter only. No FaceID.

C — STRUCTURE REFERENCE
Only if B cannot preserve geometry/pose sufficiently, add ONE stock structural condition at a time: line/edge first; pose/depth only when the target requires it. Do not stack controls blindly.

D — COMBINED
Only if B and C each independently show measurable benefit without critical regressions, combine them.

## MEASUREMENT / QC
No visual PASS without a controlled A/B/C comparison on the same source, prompt intent, output size and fixed/reported seed.

Required machine evidence per run:
- exact workflow hash;
- source-reference SHA256;
- model/adapter/control hashes;
- seed / denoise / sampler / steps / CFG;
- wall time;
- peak VRAM or OOM state;
- output SHA256.

Required ZORR visual checks from #199/#201/#202:
- identity drift = FAIL;
- silhouette / primary contour readable;
- structural internal lines controlled;
- tone organization remains deliberate rather than continuous glossy 3D;
- no external aesthetic binding becomes production authority;
- structured geometry/pose evidence stays separate from final raster judgement.

## 4 GB FAIL-CLOSED RULE
Benchmark current ComfyUI DynamicVRAM/default offload behavior first. Do not migrate model family before measuring the SD1.5 baseline. If ordinary VAE is the actual OOM point, evaluate core tiled VAE as a bounded fallback; otherwise leave it unchanged.

## IMAGE LAW
This task currently authorizes engine construction, inspection, configuration and QC design only.
DO NOT GENERATE A NEW IMAGE until OWNER explicitly writes `ГЕНЕРИРУЙ ИЗОБРАЖЕНИЕ`.
DO NOT EDIT AN EXISTING IMAGE until OWNER explicitly writes `РЕДАКТИРУЙ ИЗОБРАЖЕНИЕ`.

## TERMINAL STATES
`RUNTIME_INVENTORY_PASS` = exact current node/model inventory captured.
`WORKFLOW_READY_NOT_RUN` = stock workflow/config assembled but no image execution authorized.
`VISUAL_PASS` = forbidden without explicit image command + fresh controlled output/QC evidence.
`BLOCKED` = exact missing node/model/license/runtime layer identified; do not replace it with custom code.

MERGE = NO
CANON = NO
PRODUCTION_ACTIVATION = NO
NEXT = perform read-only current ComfyUI inventory; then assemble the smallest stock-node workflow variant that the inventory actually supports.
